<title>THAILAND: Port conditions update - Thailand - Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Thailand - Lloyds.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>BANGKOK, Aug 30 - sixteen vessels presently awaiting berths. From Aug 24 to Aug 30, berthing delay for general cargo and timber vessels ranged from nil to three days.</p>
</text>
